    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Circus</strong> is a difficult precision-platformer where you play as <strong>Dik</strong>, a skilled acrobat on a daring quest to rescue his brother from the grasp of the <strong>Devil</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/7223ff040647b453c4dd98871e50cf6c.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/7223ff040647b453c4dd98871e50cf6c.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/7223ff040647b453c4dd98871e50cf6c.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum physics based movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismemberment - Dik can loose legs and can still continue to roll and jump, however if you loose your both hands you start over</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have any weapon, but still can defeat bosses and dodge enemies with control of the environment</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit multiple different biomes with different physics (eg. Ocean, Cosmos)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique traversal and lethal obstacles like Rotating Gear, Portals, Saws, Cannons, Levers, Spikes, Trampolines, Air and Water Currents, Gargoyles, Sharks, Whales, Elephants and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive gameplay, don't give up, get up and try again until you perfect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will have a demo at Q1 2025 and will be released later in 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/03def20e1804e63d9f17e0f5b9fcd13e.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/03def20e1804e63d9f17e0f5b9fcd13e.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/03def20e1804e63d9f17e0f5b9fcd13e.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his brother <strong>Alex</strong> is abducted into the dark portal, <strong>Dik</strong> must take on the <strong>Hardcore Circus Challenge</strong>\u2014a perilous journey through the fiery depths of Hell to rescue his brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/49f4298ecca945f016d7bfe4e2644e28.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/49f4298ecca945f016d7bfe4e2644e28.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/49f4298ecca945f016d7bfe4e2644e28.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face twisted environments and brutal challenges that will push your acrobatic abilities to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/82a01e1377629181311c324231b37489.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/82a01e1377629181311c324231b37489.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/82a01e1377629181311c324231b37489.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the hardcore trials and bring <strong>Alex</strong> back, or will the <strong>Devil</strong>'s game end in tragedy? Time is running out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/83057a7dfde8bbe2148fc172a01fbf64.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/83057a7dfde8bbe2148fc172a01fbf64.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/83057a7dfde8bbe2148fc172a01fbf64.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Circus</strong> is a difficult precision-platformer where you play as <strong>Dik</strong>, a skilled acrobat on a daring quest to rescue his brother from the grasp of the <strong>Devil</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/7223ff040647b453c4dd98871e50cf6c.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/7223ff040647b453c4dd98871e50cf6c.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/7223ff040647b453c4dd98871e50cf6c.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum physics based movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismemberment - Dik can loose legs and can still continue to roll and jump, however if you loose your both hands you start over</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have any weapon, but still can defeat bosses and dodge enemies with control of the environment</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit multiple different biomes with different physics (eg. Ocean, Cosmos)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique traversal and lethal obstacles like Rotating Gear, Portals, Saws, Cannons, Levers, Spikes, Trampolines, Air and Water Currents, Gargoyles, Sharks, Whales, Elephants and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive gameplay, don't give up, get up and try again until you perfect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will have a demo at Q1 2025 and will be released later in 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/03def20e1804e63d9f17e0f5b9fcd13e.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/03def20e1804e63d9f17e0f5b9fcd13e.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/03def20e1804e63d9f17e0f5b9fcd13e.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his brother <strong>Alex</strong> is abducted into the dark portal, <strong>Dik</strong> must take on the <strong>Hardcore Circus Challenge</strong>\u2014a perilous journey through the fiery depths of Hell to rescue his brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/49f4298ecca945f016d7bfe4e2644e28.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/49f4298ecca945f016d7bfe4e2644e28.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/49f4298ecca945f016d7bfe4e2644e28.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face twisted environments and brutal challenges that will push your acrobatic abilities to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/82a01e1377629181311c324231b37489.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/82a01e1377629181311c324231b37489.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/82a01e1377629181311c324231b37489.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the hardcore trials and bring <strong>Alex</strong> back, or will the <strong>Devil</strong>'s game end in tragedy? Time is running out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/83057a7dfde8bbe2148fc172a01fbf64.poster.avif?t=1748535226\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/83057a7dfde8bbe2148fc172a01fbf64.webm?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/83057a7dfde8bbe2148fc172a01fbf64.mp4?t=1748535226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
